<h1>Rules</h1>

<p>Patterns we might want in faro, one page each: what the rule is, the evidence for it, and good and bad examples. Each one starts as a <em>proposal</em> for the team to discuss; only <em>accepted</em> rules are agreed conventions. Pages marked <em>AI draft</em> were written entirely by AI; every accepted rule is rewritten by a person first.</p>

{{#each categories}}
  <h2 id="{{slug}}">{{name}}</h2>

  <ul class="doc-list">
    {{#each rules}}
      <li>
        <a href="/rules/{{id}}/">{{id}}</a>
        <p><small><mark data-status="{{status}}">{{status}}</mark>{{#if ai_drafted}} · <span data-ai-draft>AI draft</span>{{/if}}</small></p>
        <p class="byline">{{description}}</p>
      </li>
    {{/each}}
  </ul>
{{/each}}
